Not if you believe his doctors.

203
00:09:22,020 --> 00:09:23,580
Oh, my god, do you smell gas?

204
00:09:25,210 --> 00:09:25,600
No.

205
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:26,350
Yeah, no.

206
00:09:32,210 --> 00:09:33,840
You know, they have dvds over there.

207
